  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Int 303.01 Fee Schedule. The fees required by the board under RSA 326-I shall be as set forth in the Table 303.1 Fee Schedule below:\n\nTable 303.1 Fee Schedule\n\nApplication Fee | $ 50.00\n\nLicense Fee | $150.00\n\nLicense Renewal Fee | $175.00\n\nLicense Restoration Fee | $200.00\n\nReinstatement of License Fee | $250.00\n\nSource. #7810, EMERGENCY, eff 12-26-02, EXPIRES: 6-24-03; ss #7853, eff 3-12-03, EXPIRED: 3-12-11\n\nNew. #9942, INTERIM, eff 6-18-11, EXPIRED: 12-15-11\n\nNew. #10041, eff 12-16-11",
